  When you blow an ordinary whistle  you produce a high whistling sound and
your dog, immediately heads in your direction.  Particularly useful if you
are  teleporting randomly.  Magic whistles produce  a  strange  whistling
sound,  and teleport your dog to you.  Be careful, whistling may also wake
up other denizens of the level.Any Corpses promptly placed in the large or
ice box will not spoil. It is, however, incredibly  heavy  and you must be
carrying both the box and the corpse to use it. You may want to leave it on
the first level and go back for it when you've gained some strength.
The Camera Flash in the direction  of any monsters you wish to blind
including yourself if you want to.It usually lasts anything from 3-30 turns.
Use the pick axe to dig down or around,Useful when in a leprachauns magic
vault or if you can pick one up while in a shop. The shopkeeper will ask
you to leave it outside if you try to take it in and will even catch it
if you try to throw it in.The leash can be used keep your pet within one
square of you but this can be annoying
The frost and fire horn's are similar to the wands of fire,cold but occur
when you apply the horn and play a random tune.
The drum of earthquake creates a pit in a square nearby to you.
Bag of tricks: when you try to apply this you will have monsters appear which
can sometimes stop you from starving to death. The bag of holding is supposed
to let you carry things around for less weight but I have found that this
is a little suspect myself.
Magic Flute Causes sleep in sector around you and the Magic Harp Causes
taming in 1 sector around you most times while the credit card,lock pick
and skeleton key can open any door,chest. The mirror is used to kill the
medusa and also can scare some monsters with there own reflection .If you
are blind and apply it at yourself it can tell you the level that the
medusa is on or if she is dead the level that the Wizard is on.
Magic Marker,see sections on Scrolls and Elbereth.
The crystal ball can be used to detect food,items monsters.
The stethoscope is used to find out the strenght of a monster, ie its
current hit points ,maxm hit points etc.
The tinning kit is used to can dead monsters which can be eaten later and
can be very useful when you have dead trolls,dragons,giants,wriaths etc
and you're stuffed.The can opener or blessed tins (from a blessed kit)
can open the cans in one turn.

