You only need two items:  a ring of polymorph, and a ring of polymorph
control.

Warnings:
I am not sure if you lose luck or not by killing your pets.  So if you are
worried about that, make the baby dragons kill themselves with a ring of
conflict.  If you are worried about over-eating, use a tinning kit to can
each one first.
Also there is the worry of dying of system shock caused by the polymorphing
to yourself.

